            run on both before deciding — many dealers carrying Life
            Fitness's commercial lineup will let serious buyers test both
            models in a showroom. The difference in deck length and motor
            headroom is far easier to feel than to judge from a spec sheet
            alone, and at this price, that firsthand test is worth the
            trip.
          </p>
